<title>UK: DB Capital Markets has D. Telekom warrants.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets has D. Telekom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued 1.5 million American-style call and put warrants, in marks, in three equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom AG, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.NOV.96-19.DEC.yy   PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> WARRANTS	   STRIKE*	   ISS PRICE*</p>
<p> CALL A	     100.0 PCT	 8.84 PCT</p>
<p> CALL B	     120.0 PCT	 2.69 PCT</p>
<p> PUT C		100.0 PCT	 7.84 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*AS PCT OF THE FIRST SHARE PRICE QUOTED ON FFT SE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
